WEBVTT

00:02.170 --> 00:06.460
Due to the power of a gate that the humans
created with spatial-teleportation magic,

00:06.460 --> 00:10.290
Vermilio and Helck get cast away
to a strange remote island.

00:10.830 --> 00:14.040
After being saved from a sticky situation
by none other than Helck,

00:14.040 --> 00:16.540
Vermilio becomes uncertain
about where his allegiance lies

00:16.540 --> 00:18.500
and wonders whether he's friend or foe.

00:19.790 --> 00:22.880
So, this is where you
wretched outsiders got off to.

00:23.460 --> 00:28.080
I've heard that you've been going 'round
and making a playground of our island.

00:28.580 --> 00:30.250
Come with me.

00:30.250 --> 00:32.540
We're gonna need to have a little chat.

00:58.420 --> 01:00.670
Kurui dashita haguruma ga

01:00.670 --> 01:03.380
Kanakirigoe de sakendeiru

01:03.380 --> 01:05.380
Hibana o chirasu unmei

01:05.380 --> 01:08.210
Moeagaru suki o ukagau mitai

01:08.460 --> 01:10.540
Yabai card hikiateta

01:10.540 --> 01:13.170
Pinch no toki koso chance da

01:13.170 --> 01:15.080
Mada akiramete nanka nai

01:15.080 --> 01:17.960
Saigo made tatsu mono ga shousha da

01:18.170 --> 01:20.330
Hohoemi kakeru akuma

01:20.330 --> 01:23.080
To te o toriatte odorou

01:23.080 --> 01:25.330
Narifuri kamau koto wa nai

01:25.330 --> 01:27.670
Gekijou ni yuragu ketsui

01:27.670 --> 01:30.630
Yami ni nomarete shimau mae ni

01:30.830 --> 01:31.500
Break it

01:31.500 --> 01:33.000
Keriagero

01:33.000 --> 01:36.080
Kudakechiru no wa kimi no joushiki da

01:36.080 --> 01:40.580
Dare ni mo makenai honoo kokoro ni daite

01:40.880 --> 01:46.330
Ima hateshinai sekai ni sasageru kono inori ga

01:46.330 --> 01:51.080
Kanau asu ga kuru made taeru koto naku

01:51.080 --> 01:52.710
Moyashi tsuzukeru

01:52.710 --> 01:55.580
It's my soul

02:02.960 --> 02:07.880
<b>Invasion</b>

02:10.920 --> 02:12.880
Follow me this way.

02:13.130 --> 02:16.380
This guy has more gravitas
than anybody else I've met on the island.

02:16.380 --> 02:18.040
He must be the village chief.

02:18.670 --> 02:20.710
I needed to be more sensible earlier.

02:21.130 --> 02:24.130
Visitors on this island
must be few and far between.

02:24.130 --> 02:26.210
It's only fair that the locals be wary of us.

02:26.210 --> 02:29.670
I should have made it a point to introduce
myself to the chief when I stopped by the village.

02:29.880 --> 02:30.830
Anne.

02:30.830 --> 02:33.000
He's practically foaming at the mouth.

02:33.000 --> 02:34.460
We need to proceed with caution.

02:34.710 --> 02:35.790
No way!

02:35.790 --> 02:37.710
Even Helck is worried about this guy?!

02:38.790 --> 02:40.670
Where the hell is he taking us to?

02:51.750 --> 02:55.920
Did you really think we'd just welcome
a pair of strangers with open arms?

02:57.500 --> 03:00.330
Because yer goddamn right we will!
Roll out the red carpet, y'all!

03:00.330 --> 03:01.880
Yay!

03:02.000 --> 03:04.830
Yer gonna have a rip-roaring time here!
Ya dumb dingdongs!

03:04.960 --> 03:06.830
Come on, y'all! Bring out the food!

03:07.040 --> 03:09.000
Howdya like that! Did we surprise ya?!

03:09.000 --> 03:12.330
I was just tryin' to hoodwink ya
with that grumpy act earlier!

03:16.210 --> 03:19.210
Guess it was a big flop!
She's not surprised at all!

03:19.210 --> 03:21.670
We're sorry this had to be done
in such a roundabout way.

03:21.670 --> 03:23.880
That's just the kind of person our chief is.

03:24.040 --> 03:26.540
It's all because you brought her
to the village earlier, dummy!

03:26.540 --> 03:28.000
Sorry about that!

03:28.000 --> 03:29.880
It's okay, gramps! Don't sweat it!

03:30.920 --> 03:32.380
Wait, you knew?!

03:32.380 --> 03:34.290
Then what was all that
"proceed with caution" crap?!

03:34.290 --> 03:35.750
Gosh, I'm sorry.

03:35.750 --> 03:38.420
But wow, you're a really hard person
to surprise, Anne!

03:38.420 --> 03:40.080
I was caught by surprise a little bit!

03:40.080 --> 03:41.040
YOU FOOL!

03:41.330 --> 03:43.290
That's what I like to hear!

03:44.540 --> 03:47.170
It's an honor for us to be so warmly welcomed.

03:47.170 --> 03:50.500
Please allow me to express my sincerest gratitude
at your kindness in preparing this feast.

03:50.500 --> 03:52.000
Aw shucks, don't mention it!

03:52.000 --> 03:53.630
Life on this island can be boring,

03:53.630 --> 03:56.790
so we're real happy to have
the two of ya come and liven things up!

03:56.920 --> 04:00.210
Also, I really appreciate all the clothes
and bedding that you lent us.

04:00.630 --> 04:02.500
Thank you for everything.

04:02.500 --> 04:05.920
If you wanna thank somebody for that,
then save it for the big beefcake over there!

04:05.920 --> 04:06.540
Huh?

04:06.540 --> 04:09.540
I agreed to share our supplies
in exchange for his help with a bunch of stuff.

04:09.540 --> 04:12.330
Said the whole thing was his fault anyways.

04:13.710 --> 04:16.250
His mind was on you pretty much
the entire time, ya know.

04:16.250 --> 04:19.000
Come on, gramps! That was a secret!

04:19.000 --> 04:20.290
What's that supposed to mean?

04:20.880 --> 04:22.960
Anyhoo, enough formalities!
It's time to party!

04:22.960 --> 04:24.130
Drink and stuff yer faces!

04:24.130 --> 04:25.830
Yay!

04:28.670 --> 04:29.830
Wow!

04:29.830 --> 04:31.630
So yer ship is already built?

04:31.630 --> 04:34.210
Yeah, I'm pretty sure that's the finished product.

04:34.380 --> 04:38.750
So all ya need now is to figure out
which direction leads back to the continent, eh?

04:39.040 --> 04:41.000
You don't know either, sir?

04:41.000 --> 04:42.210
No clue!

04:42.420 --> 04:45.710
I've never once thought about
leaving the island, after all!

04:46.000 --> 04:47.750
But there's nothing to fret about!

04:47.750 --> 04:50.920
The Great Witch should be making her way down
from the mountains real soon!

04:50.920 --> 04:51.750
Who is that?

04:51.750 --> 04:52.580
An old biddy!

04:52.580 --> 04:53.630
Hush!

04:54.250 --> 04:57.000
There's a revered witch who lives atop
that mountain over there.

04:57.000 --> 04:59.330
And she's a wealth of information!

04:59.330 --> 05:02.330
The Great Witch should be able to tell ya
the way back to the continent.

05:02.460 --> 05:04.750
Can we not just go and see her ourselves?

05:04.750 --> 05:06.500
That ain't possible I'm afraid!

05:06.500 --> 05:08.960
These dumdums would visit
the Great Witch every day

05:08.960 --> 05:11.500
and all their goofing off
got in the way of her research!

05:11.500 --> 05:12.500
Whoopsies!

05:12.790 --> 05:17.000
So, at some point, the Great Witch
raised a magical barrier around the mountain.

05:17.000 --> 05:21.790
Now even if ya try to climb it, ya just end up
back at the bottom before ya know it.

05:22.170 --> 05:23.790
Anyhoo, nothing to worry about!

05:23.790 --> 05:26.750
She'll come down either tomorrow
or the day after!

05:26.960 --> 05:29.460
Just take it easy and enjoy yerself
in the meantime.

05:31.920 --> 05:33.460
Take it easy...

05:54.960 --> 05:56.920
You seem pretty tired.

05:58.170 --> 06:00.790
The villagers won't leave me alone.

06:01.040 --> 06:05.380
We were together all day fishing,
touring, having parties, and more.

06:05.710 --> 06:09.420
I can handle it fine physically,
but mentally I'm just exhausted.

06:09.710 --> 06:11.920
They want to go fishing again tomorrow
AND the day after!

06:11.920 --> 06:13.880
How can anybody love fishing so much?!

06:14.250 --> 06:17.710
If it's such a problem for you,
why don't you just tell them no?

06:17.710 --> 06:19.880
I'd feel awful if I turned them down!

06:19.880 --> 06:22.250
Especially since they've been
so gracious in welcoming us!

06:22.630 --> 06:25.170
And I mean, it's not as if
I dislike having company.

06:25.170 --> 06:28.670
I just wish they would give me
a little break sometimes, you know?

06:28.670 --> 06:31.170
Gosh, you're such a good person.

06:31.170 --> 06:34.000
You may be a perpetual frowner,
but you've got a big heart!

06:34.290 --> 06:35.710
What's gotten into you?

06:35.710 --> 06:38.080
These island folks are just like
everybody in the demon realm-

06:38.080 --> 06:40.540
or rather, the citizens of the Empire.

06:40.540 --> 06:44.040
I never imagined that the people living
outside the human kingdom were so kind.

06:44.580 --> 06:46.960
It goes to show you can't judge
anyone until you've met them!

06:46.960 --> 06:48.710
You're such a simpleton.

06:48.710 --> 06:51.460
I mean, you just happened
to meet one good person.

06:51.960 --> 06:54.790
But there are plenty of vile
and ruthless demonkin out there.

06:54.790 --> 06:57.500
In fact, there's a barbarian tribe
that lives in the forests south of the Empire

06:57.500 --> 06:59.420
who fit that description to a tee.

06:59.420 --> 07:02.210
Not to mention that the Empire
has its own evildoers who swindle people!

07:02.670 --> 07:07.920
So what if you met one kindhearted person?
That doesn't mean it's true of an entire race!

07:08.540 --> 07:10.290
Oh man...

07:10.290 --> 07:11.710
Uh, I'm sorry.

07:11.710 --> 07:14.880
I was just trying to say that bad people
do exist in the world.

07:14.880 --> 07:16.630
I didn't mean to bring you down.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.080
Sorry.

07:18.080 --> 07:20.790
No. You are absolutely right.

07:21.170 --> 07:24.040
And I'm sure there are people
waiting for you to come back home.

07:24.040 --> 07:27.000
So it's best for us to stay vigilant
until we return to the Empire.

07:27.000 --> 07:28.540
Here! Dig in.

07:29.130 --> 07:31.250
Th-thank you.

07:33.000 --> 07:34.000
Say...

07:34.250 --> 07:35.500
What is it?

07:35.500 --> 07:40.460
Why did you try and save me
when I was getting sucked up by that gate?

07:41.670 --> 07:45.540
What kind of question is that?
Because you're one of my friends, obviously!

07:46.000 --> 07:48.920
I mean, you all gave
a human like me a warm welcome!

07:48.920 --> 07:52.170
Just how the people of this island did for us.

07:52.710 --> 07:54.920
And I'm incredibly grateful for that.

07:56.170 --> 07:58.130
It really came as a shock!

07:58.130 --> 08:00.580
I thought the demonkin would reject me for sure.

08:00.580 --> 08:02.830
You can't believe how happy I was to be wrong!

08:02.830 --> 08:04.420
The demon realm rocks!

08:05.580 --> 08:08.670
Now I feel guilty for suspecting him
of being up to no good!

08:09.040 --> 08:12.000
I mean... I was already alone at that point.

08:12.250 --> 08:15.670
Since all of my old human friends
had become my enemies.

08:15.920 --> 08:18.630
So, yeah, I really appreciate it.

08:19.920 --> 08:22.580
It's true what they say. Living in solitary is...

08:23.130 --> 08:24.380
painful.

08:25.880 --> 08:26.960
Helck?

08:27.290 --> 08:28.250
Oh!

08:28.580 --> 08:29.880
My apologies.

08:29.880 --> 08:31.710
I went off on a weird tangent, huh?

08:32.540 --> 08:33.540
No.

08:34.630 --> 08:37.040
That one winged knight...

08:37.710 --> 08:39.210
Edil, you called him?

08:40.130 --> 08:43.330
Did he used to be one of your comrades?

08:44.290 --> 08:46.630
Yep. That's right.

08:46.830 --> 08:48.500
He was a very precious friend of mine,

08:48.500 --> 08:50.790
who always treated me like an older brother.

08:51.670 --> 08:54.380
We worked together for many years
on monster slaying quests.

08:54.380 --> 08:57.710
No matter what we did or where we went,
we would always do it side by side.

08:57.710 --> 09:00.880
He had a strong sense of justice
and was kind to everyone he met.

09:00.880 --> 09:02.080
A good guy...

09:02.580 --> 09:03.960
through and through.

09:05.960 --> 09:07.080
Is that so...

09:09.040 --> 09:11.170
Whoa! Looks like night came fast!

09:11.630 --> 09:13.250
We should head back to the house.

09:14.290 --> 09:15.210
Yeah.

09:17.790 --> 09:19.040
Hey, Helck?

09:19.920 --> 09:23.080
Tell me. What will you do after we get back?

09:24.500 --> 09:26.170
When we return to the Empire,

09:26.170 --> 09:29.000
will you really be able to fight against
the winged knights?

09:29.290 --> 09:30.830
They're your comrades, right?

09:30.830 --> 09:33.210
I know you must have more
old friends among them.

09:33.790 --> 09:35.830
Will you fight them? Honestly?

09:36.170 --> 09:38.330
Can you turn your sword on a friend?

09:39.170 --> 09:41.290
Yeah. Without a doubt.

09:41.500 --> 09:42.750
But why?

09:42.750 --> 09:45.000
What's driving you so hard to fight them?

09:45.290 --> 09:48.500
There must be a compelling reason that
you would turn against your friends like that!

09:48.710 --> 09:51.710
It's because... I have a score to settle.

09:52.790 --> 09:56.000
Once a human becomes awakened,
they can no longer be considered human.

09:56.420 --> 09:58.710
They're nothing but living weapons.

09:58.710 --> 10:01.790
Puppets that just follow the king's order
to commit mass murder.

10:02.630 --> 10:04.380
The Human King...

10:04.920 --> 10:07.170
They will come for your people soon.

10:07.170 --> 10:08.290
No, worse.

10:08.790 --> 10:12.250
They will cause chaos for every race
in the whole world if left unchecked.

10:13.130 --> 10:16.580
So as a fellow human,
I want to put an end to their rampage

10:16.580 --> 10:18.330
before the situation gets out of hand.

10:19.380 --> 10:20.580
Humans are...

10:21.380 --> 10:24.540
a blight on this world
that can no longer be allowed to exist.

10:33.380 --> 10:34.790
Got another one!

10:40.790 --> 10:42.960
How long do we gotta keep this up for?

10:42.960 --> 10:45.500
I'm gonna be dead meat soon!
Like actually dead!

10:45.500 --> 10:46.580
Oh, shut up.

10:46.790 --> 10:48.670
It's just until the management staff shows up.

10:48.670 --> 10:50.460
If the number of monsters grows any larger,

10:50.460 --> 10:52.750
then it's definitely going to
impede efforts to rebuild the castle.

10:53.000 --> 10:55.000
Quit making me repeat myself.

10:55.000 --> 10:58.080
Yeah, I know.
I was just getting in a bit of whine time.

10:58.080 --> 11:00.130
If you're done with that,
then hurry and get moving.

11:00.130 --> 11:01.000
Okay.

11:01.000 --> 11:04.000
And the next time you bring more than two at once,
you're the one getting sliced!

11:04.290 --> 11:05.420
Okay.

11:13.080 --> 11:14.040
The hell?!

11:16.920 --> 11:18.500
More winged knights!

11:18.500 --> 11:21.210
The next unit is here already? That was fast!

11:21.420 --> 11:24.290
Wouldja look at that.
No sign of him, like I figured.

11:24.290 --> 11:26.880
Guess that punk Edil
must have gotten his ass kicked, huh?

11:29.830 --> 11:31.080
Be careful.

11:31.080 --> 11:33.790
One of them might be the second coming
of the Demon Lord.

11:33.790 --> 11:35.710
Then we need to take them down.

11:35.710 --> 11:37.750
We're heroes, after all.

11:37.750 --> 11:39.580
Huh? Am I seeing this right?

11:39.580 --> 11:41.080
Is that one a woman?

11:42.080 --> 11:43.880
Oh man, don't tell me!

11:43.880 --> 11:46.710
I bet Edil dropped his guard around the woman
and it blew up in his face!

11:46.710 --> 11:49.040
The fact these ones can speak must mean...

11:49.210 --> 11:50.960
Watch out, you two.

11:50.960 --> 11:54.250
All of these winged knights
must have a high awakening rate.

11:54.630 --> 11:55.460
Oh yeah.

11:55.460 --> 11:57.460
They were talking about that before, huh?

11:58.380 --> 11:59.460
Oh?

12:00.750 --> 12:03.290
It seems like you guys know quite a lot.

12:03.290 --> 12:06.170
Your mildly handsome shithead of a friend
gave it all away to us.

12:06.170 --> 12:08.040
"Mildly handsome shithead"?

12:08.040 --> 12:09.670
She must be talking about Edil.

12:09.670 --> 12:11.040
That's a surprise.

12:11.040 --> 12:14.920
I never pegged him as the type
to spill the beans to the enemy.

12:14.920 --> 12:17.170
Maybe he just got careless
'cause she's a woman?

12:17.170 --> 12:19.710
But she's a demonkin! That's gross as hell!

12:19.710 --> 12:22.080
Dammit. This jackass really pisses me off.

12:22.080 --> 12:22.960
Yo!

12:22.960 --> 12:24.460
Demon hag!

12:24.750 --> 12:29.080
If he really told you everything,
then you must know what our end goal is, right?

12:29.080 --> 12:29.960
Huh?

12:29.960 --> 12:33.290
Make this easy and just tell us
where your boss is.

12:33.670 --> 12:36.380
That way we can go turn him into mincemeat,

12:36.380 --> 12:38.670
and secure peace for the world.

12:38.670 --> 12:40.750
Give us what we want
without putting up a fight,

12:40.750 --> 12:42.920
and I promise you won't suffer
on your way down to Hell.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.130
Hot damn!

12:46.130 --> 12:47.330
That was a nice slash!

12:47.710 --> 12:51.380
You goddamn humans always
have nothing on your mind but yourselves.

12:51.750 --> 12:53.670
It really gets on my nerves.

12:54.000 --> 12:55.170
Say your prayers!

13:02.540 --> 13:03.460
She's tough!

13:03.460 --> 13:04.710
We're joining the fight!

13:12.380 --> 13:13.330
Curses!

13:13.330 --> 13:16.790
These winged knights really are in
a different league compared to the others!

13:19.670 --> 13:20.540
Oh hell!

13:21.580 --> 13:22.750
Hyura!

13:25.330 --> 13:26.750
Whoa! You're okay!

13:26.750 --> 13:29.670
That stupid shit stain.
He could've killed his friend with that attack!

13:29.670 --> 13:31.420
Man, you're awesome!

13:31.420 --> 13:33.330
You might win this all by yourself!

13:33.330 --> 13:35.670
Unfortunately, it's not that simple.

13:36.290 --> 13:37.170
Just look...

13:44.130 --> 13:46.460
There are way too many of them.

13:54.630 --> 13:55.750
She's formidable.

13:56.630 --> 13:58.960
Now I understand why Edil didn't survive.

13:59.330 --> 14:00.330
Yep.

14:00.630 --> 14:03.790
It's no surprise, but it seems we still
don't stand a chance one-on-one.

14:04.040 --> 14:05.080
Dorsche.

14:05.080 --> 14:07.670
How long will it take for you
to raise that super barrier of yours?

14:07.670 --> 14:10.540
Another 27 minutes or so, I'd say.

14:10.750 --> 14:13.380
However, I am far from being in peak form.

14:13.380 --> 14:16.000
You really shouldn't pin your hopes on me.

14:16.000 --> 14:17.750
I have a great idea!

14:17.750 --> 14:18.920
Let's hightail it!

14:19.040 --> 14:21.330
Do you seriously think
that you can outrun all of them?

14:21.330 --> 14:22.290
Sure do!

14:22.290 --> 14:23.420
That was a quick answer.

14:23.420 --> 14:25.330
All right, then make a break for it by yourself.

14:25.330 --> 14:26.210
Huh?!

14:26.420 --> 14:28.790
Don't kill any of them
until they give us the info we want.

14:28.790 --> 14:30.170
I know.

14:30.170 --> 14:31.250
Don't be stupid!

14:31.250 --> 14:33.500
There's no way I'm just
going to leave you guys behind!

14:33.500 --> 14:35.040
I'll fight, too!

14:35.040 --> 14:37.880
We all know you can't put up
much of a fight without any weapons.

14:38.170 --> 14:39.420
Just get going.

14:39.420 --> 14:42.170
You need to tell the management staff
what happened here.

14:42.170 --> 14:43.830
They should be able to
keep casualties to a minimum

14:43.830 --> 14:45.670
if they have time
to prepare against an assault.

14:45.670 --> 14:47.960
I shall open up a path for you.

14:48.290 --> 14:49.460
Use it and go.

14:50.920 --> 14:52.460
Aw, man...

14:52.460 --> 14:53.630
We're counting on you.

14:54.330 --> 14:56.000
That won't be necessary!

15:02.330 --> 15:03.500
Reinforcements?

15:03.500 --> 15:05.420
The woman is the only one we need alive.

15:05.420 --> 15:07.040
We'll kill the rest of them!

15:07.250 --> 15:08.250
Attack!

15:19.580 --> 15:20.670
Let me handle this!

15:24.630 --> 15:26.420
What the? My attack did nothing...

15:28.580 --> 15:31.750
Compared to dealing with her outbursts,
this is like child's play.

15:31.960 --> 15:33.630
Th-there's no way...

15:34.830 --> 15:35.960
Isty?!

15:35.960 --> 15:38.130
It's been a long time! Hyuran!

15:38.380 --> 15:39.580
"Ran"...?

15:39.790 --> 15:43.000
My apologies for arriving so late, everyone.

15:43.000 --> 15:44.460
Everything is okay now!

15:44.460 --> 15:47.330
Isty! What are you even doing here?

15:47.330 --> 15:50.210
I thought you were busy
working over in the southern region.

15:50.210 --> 15:51.830
Wait! Don't tell me...!

15:51.830 --> 15:53.500
Save it for later, Hyuran!

15:53.750 --> 15:56.460
Right now, we need to subdue
all of these winged knights.

15:56.460 --> 15:59.960
What? Are you saying
we're going to beat them?

15:59.960 --> 16:02.210
That's insane!
There are way too many of them!

16:02.210 --> 16:04.580
Oh, you don't have to worry about that.

16:04.580 --> 16:07.920
We've brought a supremely powerful force
to fight against them.

16:07.920 --> 16:08.710
Huh?

16:08.710 --> 16:10.830
Wow! You brought an army with you?!

16:11.130 --> 16:12.580
Anyway, just stick with us!

16:12.580 --> 16:13.330
Come on!

16:13.330 --> 16:14.330
Wait up!

16:14.330 --> 16:15.670
They're trying to escape!

16:15.670 --> 16:16.380
It's hopeless!

16:16.380 --> 16:18.830
Nobody can escape from a thousand heroes!

16:29.960 --> 16:31.330
I need my sweets!

16:31.330 --> 16:32.670
Zing!

16:35.960 --> 16:37.960
Their stamina can't last very long.

16:37.960 --> 16:39.040
Follow them.

16:48.880 --> 16:52.040
Done already? Strong start, but weak finish.

16:52.040 --> 16:53.000
Okay!

16:53.000 --> 16:55.210
Kill them all except the
first woman we encountered!

16:55.210 --> 16:56.250
Isty!

16:57.500 --> 16:59.540
It's all right, we made it far enough.

16:59.540 --> 17:00.420
Huh?

17:20.960 --> 17:22.080
Huh?

17:22.080 --> 17:23.500
Where's the army?

17:23.500 --> 17:24.960
We're the only ones who came.

17:24.960 --> 17:26.830
What?! Are you for real?!

17:26.830 --> 17:28.130
You dumbass.

17:28.130 --> 17:31.540
They brought an elite with them
who's far more dependable than any army.

17:31.540 --> 17:32.630
Except...

17:32.630 --> 17:34.500
what's up with that mask?

17:35.420 --> 17:36.380
Beats me!

17:39.290 --> 17:40.460
Be careful.

17:40.460 --> 17:43.500
I can tell something is different about that one.

17:43.500 --> 17:45.000
Is he the new Demon Lord?

17:45.000 --> 17:45.920
Huh?

17:45.920 --> 17:49.210
There's no way in hell a clown like that
could be the Demon Lord!

17:49.460 --> 17:51.080
Did you say clown?

17:54.170 --> 17:58.330
Because you're the only clowns
that I see around here, humans.

18:01.210 --> 18:02.710
Lord Azudra...

18:03.080 --> 18:06.460
Apparently, Lord Azudra is quite concerned
about people being afraid of him,

18:06.460 --> 18:09.710
which is why he goes out of his way
to make sure we never see his angry side.

18:09.710 --> 18:10.540
Huh?

18:10.540 --> 18:15.210
Both Lord Urum and Lord Thor were people
who Lord Azudra considered good friends.

18:15.210 --> 18:18.000
He knew he wouldn't be able
to hold back his rage at their deaths,

18:18.000 --> 18:20.790
so he made sure to
put on that mask ahead of time.

18:20.790 --> 18:22.460
Lord Azudra...

18:22.670 --> 18:26.500
But jeez, I'm sure he could have
taken the time to prepare a better mask.

18:26.500 --> 18:28.380
Why in the world did he use that one?

18:28.750 --> 18:30.960
I guess there's no real meaning behind it...

18:31.290 --> 18:34.670
Listen, humans, turn around
and go back to your country.

18:35.290 --> 18:38.670
I would prefer to avoid fighting you
if at all possible.

18:38.670 --> 18:39.630
What?

18:40.290 --> 18:41.830
The bastard had me scared for a second!

18:41.830 --> 18:43.880
But I guess he's nothing but a jokester!

18:43.880 --> 18:45.130
Come now, humans.

18:45.460 --> 18:49.210
You know war is a foolish act
that brings nothing but tragedy after tragedy.

18:49.210 --> 18:51.330
We all share this world we live in.

18:51.330 --> 18:53.880
So why don't you say that we find a way
to coexist instead?

18:54.080 --> 18:56.250
Oh! I like the sound of that!

18:56.250 --> 18:57.670
Coexistence for the win!

18:57.670 --> 18:58.630
I disagree.

18:58.630 --> 19:00.630
Coexist with you demon scum?

19:00.630 --> 19:01.750
Ridiculous!

19:01.750 --> 19:03.750
There's no way in hell that can happen!

19:03.750 --> 19:04.960
Oh, but it can.

19:05.250 --> 19:08.170
Look back far enough in the past
and you'll find a period of time

19:08.170 --> 19:10.580
where we demonkin
and you humans did coexist.

19:11.670 --> 19:14.130
However, a civil war broke
out amongst your people,

19:14.130 --> 19:17.580
and all contact with us was cut off
after a new human kingdom was established.

19:17.880 --> 19:20.380
But we had gotten along
just fine until that point.

19:20.380 --> 19:22.630
Sounds like a bunch of made-up bullshit to me!

19:22.630 --> 19:24.380
It's not made-up.

19:24.380 --> 19:25.960
It's a matter of fact.

19:27.250 --> 19:29.580
I won't try and rush the process.

19:29.580 --> 19:31.500
Let's take it one step at a time.

19:31.790 --> 19:34.710
Then someday, we'll have made enough
headway to reach a mutual understanding

19:34.710 --> 19:36.290
just like we did in the past.

19:37.920 --> 19:41.580
Using sweet talk to pull a fast one on us, huh?!
I see how you operate!

19:41.960 --> 19:43.170
But it's pointless!

19:43.170 --> 19:45.920
We're here to attack you
under the direct order of our king!

19:45.920 --> 19:47.710
So it doesn't matter what you try!

19:47.920 --> 19:49.710
Because nobody can overrule the king!

19:49.960 --> 19:51.630
The Human King...

19:52.210 --> 19:56.210
Besides, just look at all this
amazing power we've been given!

19:56.420 --> 19:58.790
It would be a waste not to use it!

19:59.000 --> 20:01.540
You're going to fight no matter what, then?

20:01.540 --> 20:02.750
That's our mission.

20:07.040 --> 20:08.500
Then I have no choice.

20:08.500 --> 20:11.500
There are people here who I must protect!

20:11.500 --> 20:12.630
Forgive me.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.080
What the hell is this?!

20:33.250 --> 20:35.960
Unbelievable!
Is he manipulating all these trees?!

20:49.880 --> 20:52.420
He took down a thousand heroes
in the blink of an eye!

20:52.750 --> 20:56.880
The Demon Lord... no! He's even worse!

20:57.130 --> 20:58.330
We've found him!

20:58.330 --> 21:02.460
This has to be the big boss who stands at the top
of the food chain in the demon realm!

21:03.580 --> 21:06.080
I'm the big boss at the top of the food chain?

21:06.830 --> 21:07.920
Hardly.

21:09.790 --> 21:12.960
If you must know,
I am one of the Four Elite Lords.

21:12.960 --> 21:14.460
Azudra!

21:19.750 --> 21:22.540
Yakusoku suru yo

21:22.540 --> 21:25.500
Itsuka sekai ga

21:25.500 --> 21:27.580
Owaru toki mata

21:27.580 --> 21:30.210
Deaemasu you ni

21:42.290 --> 21:47.670
Hana no you na hito datta to

21:47.670 --> 21:53.580
Dareka ga chiisaku tsubuyaiteita

21:53.580 --> 21:59.130
Mizu no nai heya soredemo tashika ni

21:59.130 --> 22:01.630
Asu e saiteita

22:03.330 --> 22:06.130
Zenbu yume dattara

22:06.130 --> 22:09.000
Kimi o shiru koto mo

22:09.000 --> 22:11.920
Koi o suru koto mo

22:11.920 --> 22:15.420
Ikiru imi sae shirazu ni

22:16.250 --> 22:19.040
Tatoeba asu ga

22:19.040 --> 22:21.750
Donna ame demo

22:21.750 --> 22:24.130
Yoru wa ake sekai ni

22:24.130 --> 22:27.210
Niji ga kakaru you ni

22:27.580 --> 22:30.290
Mune no itami mo

22:30.290 --> 22:33.170
Tsutau namida mo

22:33.170 --> 22:36.630
Mirai e no tane ni kaete

22:36.630 --> 22:38.250
Ikiyou

22:38.960 --> 22:41.000
Bukiyou na ai ga

22:41.000 --> 22:44.170
Hana o sakasu made

22:45.960 --> 22:50.750
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:45.960 --> 22:50.750
<b>The Human King</b>

22:46.630 --> 22:49.500
Next time: "The Human King"
